title: Last bite — a thing with no serving left is gone
story: eating-removal-test
description: The ration has one serving, so one bite finishes it and it can
  no longer be seen, held or eaten. The loaf has three and is gone after the
  third. The plum says its own line when it goes, after the eating line.
seed: 7

---

